    {
      "type": "note",
      "id": "s464x",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1480,
      "name": "Note layout",
      "width": 520,
      "height": 380,
      "content": "Layout\n\nOne window: the calls list on the left (340 pt, divider 280–420, kept across restarts), the selected call's summary on the right. It replaces the calls list window and the floating summary panel.\n\nRow, two lines: title and start time; then duration and the gist, the first sentence of «О чём встреча». Preparing: «Подготовка итогов…» and a spinner. Failed: «Не удалось подготовить итоги» in `rec` and the alert. No summary: an empty second line. An untitled call shows its folder name in `font-data`, `gutter`.\n\nBelow 700 pt the detail hides and the list fills the window (Calls — narrow); Return or Space opens the summary in its own window."
    },
    {
      "type": "note",
      "id": "s465x",
      "x": 560,
      "y": 1480,
      "name": "Note detail",
      "width": 520,
      "height": 380,
      "content": "Detail\n\nHeader: title, then day, start time · duration. The summary is rendered Markdown, selectable. Toolbar: Копировать (the Markdown source) and ⋯ with the row's menu: Открыть, Переименовать, Повторить итоги (failed only), Удалить….\n\nWithout a summary the detail shows one centred message under the header: preparing, failed with the error and Повторить итоги, or «Итогов нет» when notes are off. With no call selected: «Звонок не выбран». Copy and ⋯ are hidden whenever there is no summary.\n\n↑↓ moves the selection and the detail follows at once; Tab moves focus into the detail."
    },
    {
      "type": "note",
      "id": "s466x",
      "x": 1120,
      "y": 1480,
      "name": "Note search",
      "width": 520,
      "height": 380,
      "content": "Search\n\nThe field sits in the list's title bar and works as in the calls list: titles, summaries and transcripts, as you type, ignoring case and ё/е; days with no match hide.\n\nA match row keeps the two-line shape: title and time, then where the first match is (its time in the transcript, or «Итоги»), the text around it with the hit tinted `hit`, and «ещё N». The detail shows the selected call's summary. No results: the list says so and the detail shows «Звонок не выбран».\n\nEmpty, loading and the inactive window (selection in `chip`) are as in the calls list."
    }
  ],
